  "historyNote": "#8444, eff 10-06-05, EXPIRED: 10-6-13 New. #10808, eff 4-2-15, EXPIRED: 4-1-25 New. #14271, INTERIM, eff 6-16-25, EXPIRES: 12-14-25; ss by #14591, eff 7-17-26, EXPIRES: 7-17-36",
